  <description>
    Donors, one row each, with the packaged giving rollups: first and last gift date, gift
    count, gifts last year, and the fiscal year totals. Households, organizations and person
    accounts are all here, because the rollups fill the same fields on all three. This is the
    report type the retention reports are built on.
  </description>
